  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Credit Program for Safeguarding the Productive Fabric and Employment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Global de Crdito para la Defensa del Tejido Productivo y el Empleo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de este proyecto es apoyar la sostenibilidad frente a la crisis del COVID-19, de las Micro y Pequeas Empresas (MIPE) como sostn del empleo en Ecuador. El objetivo especfico es: apoyar la sostenibilidad financiera de corto plazo de las MIPE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to support the sustainability of the Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs) faced by the crisis of COVID-19 to maintain employment in Ecuador. The specific objective is to support the financial sustainability in the short term for the MSEs. .</narrative>
  </description>
